    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "entry-ticket-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "Entry Ticket &mdash; Vocabulary Test",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:38px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 12px 0\">Complete the test on your paper.</p><p style=\"font-size:38px;color:#fff;margin:0\">Answer all 20 questions. You have 5 minutes.</p>",
      "notes": "Students complete the 20-question Vocabulary Levels Test handout. Timer pill: 5 minutes (300 seconds)."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "entry-ticket-answers-1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "body": "<style>.et{border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px auto;max-width:760px;width:100%}.et td{padding:7px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:34px;vertical-align:top}.et .num{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;min-width:30px}.et .ltr{color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900;min-width:34px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:47px;margin-bottom:8px\">Entry Ticket &mdash; Answers</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span class=\"box-word\">Swap</span> and <span class=\"box-word\">mark</span>.</p><table class=\"et\"><tr><td class=\"num\">1</td><td class=\"ltr\">D</td><td>become less hot</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">2</td><td class=\"ltr\">A</td><td>put in danger</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">3</td><td class=\"ltr\">A</td><td>coming</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">4</td><td class=\"ltr\">A</td><td>enthusiasm</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">5</td><td class=\"ltr\">C</td><td>stock</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">6</td><td class=\"ltr\">B</td><td>sacred</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">7</td><td class=\"ltr\">D</td><td>wraps up</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">8</td><td class=\"ltr\">C</td><td>actors</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">9</td><td class=\"ltr\">D</td><td>steep rock</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">10</td><td class=\"ltr\">B</td><td>valuable thing</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Answers 1-10. Students swap and mark."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "entry-ticket-answers-2",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "body": "<style>.et{border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px auto;max-width:760px;width:100%}.et td{padding:7px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);color:#fff;text-align:left;font-size:34px;vertical-align:top}.et .num{color:#ffdd00;font-weight:700;min-width:30px}.et .ltr{color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900;min-width:34px}</style><h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:47px;margin-bottom:8px\">Entry Ticket &mdash; Answers</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span class=\"box-word\">Continue</span> marking.</p><table class=\"et\"><tr><td class=\"num\">11</td><td class=\"ltr\">B</td><td>mental science</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">12</td><td class=\"ltr\">B</td><td>temporary</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">13</td><td class=\"ltr\">C</td><td>wager</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">14</td><td class=\"ltr\">A</td><td>wickedness</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">15</td><td class=\"ltr\">C</td><td>wait</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">16</td><td class=\"ltr\">D</td><td>housing</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">17</td><td class=\"ltr\">B</td><td>connect</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">18</td><td class=\"ltr\">A</td><td>cutting edge</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">19</td><td class=\"ltr\">D</td><td>clapped</td></tr><tr><td class=\"num\">20</td><td class=\"ltr\">C</td><td>replacement</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Answers 11-20. Continue marking."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "recall-numbers",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Think about numbers",
      "body": "<p style=\"font-size:38px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 12px 0\">Where do you see numbers every day?</p><p style=\"font-size:38px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 22px 0\">Talk to your partner.</p><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;text-align:center;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:22px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Evidence</p>",
      "notes": "Pairs discuss for 2 minutes. Elicit ideas: prices, sport scores, timetables, weather, phone numbers."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "transition-vocab",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "Let's check your word knowledge",
      "notes": "Transition to vocabulary presentation. Say: These are words for numbers and measurements. We will learn ten of them."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-amount",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/əˈmaʊnt/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">amount</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The amount of sugar in this cake is surprisingly high. I counted four cups in the recipe.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is the amount of sugar a number or a feeling?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-average",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈævərɪdʒ/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">average</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The average temperature in July here is thirty degrees. Most days stay around that mark.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is the average the biggest number or the typical number?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-length",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/leŋθ/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">length</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The length of the swimming pool is twenty-five meters. Swimmers cover it in a few strokes.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Does length measure how long or how wide something is?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-height",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/haɪt/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">height</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The height of that tower is over three hundred meters. It dominates the whole skyline.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is the height measured from top to bottom?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-width",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/wɪdθ/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">width</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The width of the river here is about fifty meters. It narrows further upstream.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is the width measured from side to side?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-weight",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/weɪt/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">weight</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The weight of the luggage was over the limit. The airline charged us extra.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Do we measure weight in meters or in kilos?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-probability",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˌprɒbəˈbɪləti/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">probability</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The probability of winning the lottery is extremely low. You should not rely on it.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is probability about how likely or how big something is?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-percentage",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/pəˈsentɪdʒ/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">percentage</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">A large percentage of students walk to school. Around eighty percent of them do.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is a percentage a part of one hundred?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-sequence",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/ˈsiːkwəns/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">sequence</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">Put the numbers in the correct sequence. Start with one, then two, then three.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is a sequence an ordered list of items?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "vocab-sum",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:30px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 0;font-size:47px\">/sʌm/</td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\"><span class=\"box-word\">sum</span></td></tr><tr class=\"fragment\"><td style=\"padding:12px 0\">The sum of two and three is five. Just add them together.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Click 1: show word. Click 2: show context. CCQ: Is the sum the result of adding or subtracting?"
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "transition-listen",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#c0392b",
      "title": "Numbers Around School",
      "notes": "Transition to listening. Say: We will listen to a teacher and a student talking about a numbers project."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "strategy-predict",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "title": "Strategy: Predict",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Do</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555\">Predict what the student will say.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Why</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #555\">It helps your brain focus.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">How</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">Read the title. Think of topics.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Say: The title is Numbers Around School. A student talks about his project. What might he mention? Predict first, then listen."
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-predict",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Predict",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A student talks about his weekend.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Which numbers might he mention?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The price of his new trainers.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His favourite movie's plot.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The distance he cycled.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His friend's opinion of him.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Ask students to predict which numbers a student might mention. Click to reveal the checkmarks."
    },
    {
      "layout": "auto-animate-pair",
      "id": "demo-predict",
      "step": 2,
      "background_color": "#116466",
      "title": "Try it: Predict",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">A student talks about his weekend.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 0;color:#ffdd00;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Which numbers might he mention?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center;color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900\">✓</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The price of his new trainers.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His favourite movie's plot.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center;color:#2ecc71;font-weight:900\">✓</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">The distance he cycled.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;width:36px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle;border-bottom:1px solid #444\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:24px;text-align:center\">&nbsp;</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">His friend's opinion of him.</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Revealed: price and distance make sense. The plot and an opinion are not numbers."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "gist-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:48px;margin-bottom:20px\">Listen &mdash; Gist</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:38px;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto\">What is Leo doing?</p><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:24px\"><audio controls data-src=\"assets/dialog.mp3\" style=\"width:340px\"></audio></div>",
      "notes": "Play the dialog once. Students listen for the gist only: What is Leo doing? Answer: a survey project about numbers."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "gist-answer",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Gist — Answer",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">What is Leo doing?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">He is doing a survey project about numbers.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">He measures things and asks students about homework.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">\u201cI've been measuring things around school.\u201d</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Confirm the gist. Leo is collecting data for a survey project."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "detail-task",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<h2 style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:48px;margin-bottom:20px\">Listen again</h2><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:36px;margin-bottom:16px\">Answer the questions.</p><div style=\"max-width:840px;margin:0 auto\"><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">1. How long does the average student spend on homework?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">2. What percentage of students said that?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">3. What are the classroom measurements?</p><p style=\"color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:34px;margin:10px 0\">4. How does Leo organize his numbers?</p></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:16px\"><audio controls data-src=\"assets/dialog.mp3\" style=\"width:340px\"></audio></div>",
      "notes": "Play the dialog again. Students answer the four detail questions. Then go through the answer slides."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d1",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (1/4)",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">1. How long does the average student spend on homework?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">About an hour every night &mdash; that's the average.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Leo found the average was higher than he expected.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">\u201cThe average student spends about an hour on homework every night.\u201d</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Check the answer. Point out the word average from the vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d2",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (2/4)",
      "body": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:90px\">Question</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">2. What percentage of students said that?</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Answer</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Around sixty percent.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Explanation</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #444\">Most of the students Leo asked agreed.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 0;font-weight:700;color:#ffdd00;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">Transcript</td><td style=\"padding:8px 0\">\u201cAround sixty percent.\u201d</td></tr></table>",
      "notes": "Check the answer. Point out the word percentage from the vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "layout": "content",
      "id": "answer-d3",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#052e0d",
      "title": "Answers (3/4)",
